{"timestamp": "2026-07-05T05:06:57.311922", "data": {"url": "https://hk.kioxia.com/en-hk/top.html", "title": "KIOXIA Corporation Home | KIOXIA - Hong Kong (English)", "content": "Welcome to KIOXIA Corporation Please select your location and preferred language where available. Select location and language Japan (\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e) Japan (English) China (\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587) Hong Kong (English) Republic of Korea (\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4) Taiwan (\u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587) Asia Pacific (English) Brazil (Portugu\u00eas) Canada (English) United States (English) Americas (Espa\u00f1ol) France (Fran\u00e7ais) Germany (Deutsch) Greece (\u0395\u03bb\u03bb\u03b7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae) Hungary (Magyar) Italy (Italiano) Netherlands (Nederlands) Poland (Polski) Portugal (Portugu\u00eas) Spain (Espa\u00f1ol) Turkey (T\u00fcrk\u00e7e) Europe (English) Middle East & Africa (English) GO Close \u00d7 Pause Auto play 1 2 3 News Kioxia Gains Approval of its Green Gas Emission Reduction Targets by SBTi June 30, 2026 KIOXIA Holdings Announcements Response to the earthquake that occurred on June 25 in Tohoku, Japan June 25, 2026 KIOXIA Holdings Announcements Kioxia Announces Growth Strategy for the AI Inference Era at Investor Day June 02, 2026 KIOXIA Holdings News Releases All News Business product information for memory and SSD. Business Business Products Application Memory SSD KIOXIA provides various consumer products for personal use. Personal Personal Products KIOXIA Customer Support for Personal Products SSD microSD Memory Card SD Memory Card USB Flash Drive R&D to Create a New Era of Memory As a leading company in flash memory and SSD, KIOXIA delivers products that create new value. Research and development into cutting-edge technologies in many diverse fields is essential for realizing this. We implement technological innovation to pursue the potential of \u201cmemory.\u201d Research and Technology Development Yokkaichi Plant and Kitakami Plant KIOXIA Group\u2019s manufacturing sites have world-leading production scale, and state-of-the-art technologies that support the Group\u2019s sustainable growth. The operations of Yokkaichi Plant and Kitakami Plant are coordinated to meet the expanding demand for flash memory. Yokkaichi Plant Kitakami Plant (Kioxia Iwate Corporation) About KIOXIA Group About us We are the subsidiary of KIOXIA Corporation, a leading global supplier of flash memory and solid state drives (SSDs). KIOXIA Corporation (R&D / Yokkaichi Plant / Company Information) For information regarding KIOXIA Corporation's R&D, Yokkaichi Plant and corporate profile, please visit the KIOXIA Corporation website. KIOXIA Holdings Corporation (Corporate Group Information) KIOXIA Corporation is a wholly-owned subsidiary of KIOXIA Holdings Corporation. For information on group companies, please visit the KIOXIA Holdings Corporation website. Important Notices regarding Personal Products SSD Utility Management Software Now Available April 20, 2026 Important Notices Ending the Support of macOS Monterey 12 for KIOXIA USB Flash Drives February 25, 2026 Important Notices Termination of FlashAir W-04 Smartphone App Download and Support December 11, 2025 Important Notices Ending the support of Windows 10 for KIOXIA USB Flash Drives October 15, 2025 Important Notices KIOXIA USB \u96a8\u8eab\u789f\u505c\u6b62\u652f\u63f4 macOS Big Sur 11 February 14, 2025 Important Notices All Important Notices KIOXIA Insights KIOXIA Insights highlights a range of activities that align with our mission to \u201cuplift the world with \u2018memory\u2019\u201d. By evolving \u201cmemory,\u201d we create uplifting experiences and change the world. KIOXIA Corporation has officially changed its name from Toshiba Memory Corporation effective October 1, 2019. Some pages and/or documents may still include the name \"Toshiba Corporation\" or \"Toshiba Memory Corporation,\" please interpret those names to correspond to the new company name.", "lists": [["Japan (\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e)"